ind":"person","person_id":"53e_xmi_9zk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"n4f_fqh_04q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"n4f_fqh_04q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m021-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"53e_xmi_9zk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p026","text":"因東說齊宣王曰：「齊南有泰山，東有琅邪，西有清河，北有勃海，北所謂四塞之國也。齊地方二千餘里，帶甲數十萬，粟如丘山。三軍之良，五家之兵，進如鋒矢，戰如雷霆，解如風雨。即有軍役，未嘗倍泰山，絕清河，涉勃海也。臨菑之中七萬戶，臣竊度之，不下戶三男子，三七二十一萬，不待發於遠縣，而臨菑之卒固已二十一萬矣。臨菑甚富而實，其民無不吹竽鼓瑟，彈琴擊筑，鬬雞走狗，六博蹋鞠者。臨菑之塗，車轂擊，人肩摩，連衽成帷，舉袂成幕，揮汗成雨，家殷人足，志高氣揚。夫以大王之賢與齊之彊，天下莫能當。今乃西面而事秦，臣竊為大王羞之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m026-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"齊宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m026-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"三男子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m026-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"其民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m026-0222","start":222,"end":224,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m026-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p028","text":"「夫不深料秦之無奈齊何，而欲西面而事之，是羣臣之計過也。今無臣事秦之名而有彊國之實，臣是故願大王少留意計之。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m028-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"羣臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m028-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p029","text":"齊王曰：「寡人不敏，僻遠守海，窮道東境之國也，未嘗得聞餘教。今足下以趙王詔詔之，敬以國從。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m029-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"ho4_me8_not","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p040","text":"秦惠王以其女為燕太子婦。是歲，文侯卒，太子立，是為燕易王。易王初立，齊宣王因燕喪伐燕，取十城。易王謂蘇秦曰：「往日先生至燕，而先王資先生見趙，遂約六國從。今齊先伐趙，次至燕，以先生之故為天下笑，先生能為燕得侵地乎？」蘇秦大慚，曰：「請為王取之。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"6oy_t19_ywe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"其女","kind":"person","person_id":"6oy_t19_ywe_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"燕太子","kind":"person","person_id":"49x_hsj_tmo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"婦","kind":"person","person_id":"6oy_t19_ywe_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"xs7_jo2_pjd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"49x_hsj_tmo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"燕易王","kind":"person","person_id":"49x_hsj_tmo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"易王","kind":"person","person_id":"49x_hsj_tmo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"齊宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"易王","kind":"person","person_id":"49x_hsj_tmo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"xs7_jo2_pjd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m040-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p041","text":"蘇秦見齊王，再拜，俯而慶，仰而弔。齊王曰：「是何慶弔相隨之速也？」蘇秦曰：「臣聞飢人所以飢而不食烏喙者，為其愈充腹而與餓死同患也。今燕雖弱小，即秦王之少壻也。大王利其十城而長與彊秦為仇。今使弱燕為鴈行而彊秦敝其後，以招天下之精兵，是食烏喙之類也。」齊王愀然變色曰：「然則奈何？」蘇秦曰：「臣聞古之善制事者，轉禍為福，因敗為功。大王誠能聽臣計，即歸燕之十城。燕無故而得十城，必喜；秦王知以己之故而歸燕之十城，亦必喜。此所謂棄仇讎而得石交者也。夫燕、秦俱事齊，則大王號令天下，莫敢不聽。是王以虛辭附秦，以十城取天下。此霸王之業也。」王曰：「善。」於是乃歸燕之十城。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"飢人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"6oy_t19_ywe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0146","start":146,"end":152,"surface":"古之善制事者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0189","start":189,"end":191,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"6oy_t19_ywe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m041-0264","start":264,"end":265,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"iqu_pas_2r5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-069-su","book_id":"b-shiji-069","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-069-su"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:p042","text":"人有毀蘇秦者曰：「左右賣國反覆之臣也，將作亂。」蘇秦恐得罪歸，而燕王不復官也。蘇秦見燕王曰：「臣，東周之鄙人也，無有分寸之功，而王親拜之於廟而禮之於廷。今臣為王卻齊之兵而攻得十城，宜以益親。今來而王不官臣者，人必有以不信傷臣於王者。臣之不信，王之福也。臣聞忠信者，所以自為也；進取者，所以為人也。且臣之說齊王，曾非欺之也。臣棄老母於東周，固去自為而行進取也。今有孝如曾參，廉如伯夷，信如尾生。得此三人者以事大王，何若？」王曰：「足矣。」蘇秦曰：「孝如曾參，義不離其親一宿於外，王又安能使之步行千里而事弱燕之危王哉？廉如伯夷，義不為孤竹君之嗣，不肯為武王臣，不受封侯而餓死首陽山下。有廉如此，王又安能使之步行千里而行進取於齊哉？信如尾生，與女子期於梁下，女子不來，水至不去，抱柱而死。有信如此，王又安能使之步行千里卻齊之彊兵哉？臣所謂以忠信得罪於上者也。」燕王曰：「若不忠信耳，豈有以忠信而得罪者乎？」蘇秦曰：「不然。臣聞客有遠為吏而其妻私於人者，其夫將來，其私者憂之，妻曰『勿憂，吾已作藥酒待之矣』。居三日，其夫果至，妻使妾舉藥酒進之。妾欲言酒之有藥，則恐其逐主母也，欲勿言乎，則恐其殺主父也。於是乎詳僵而棄酒。主父大怒，笞之五十。故妾一僵而覆酒，上存主父，下存主母，然而不免於笞，惡在乎忠信之無罪也？夫臣之過，不幸而類是乎！」燕王曰：「先生復就故官。」益厚遇之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m042-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"人有毀","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代，未補成員、姓名及世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m042-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"98y_02x_z6o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-069-su:m042-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surf